# Data. Most CSVs are regenerable, but Stage 7 refreshes the pipeline
# outputs daily via GitHub Actions and commits them, so the repo stays a
# living dataset and the dashboard runs on a fresh clone. Track those.
# (.gitignore has no inline comments - keep the un-ignore lines bare.)
#
# Tracked:  events.csv (hand-curated) + the daily pipeline outputs below.
# Still ignored:  regimes.csv and regimes_gmm_explore.csv - exploratory
#   Stage 4 output (detect_regimes.py / compare_regimes.py re-fit each run).
data/*.csv
!data/samples/*.csv
!data/events.csv
!data/raw_prices.csv
!data/clean_prices.csv
!data/features.csv
!data/regimes_gmm.csv
!data/regime_shifts.csv

# Generated figures - regenerable by re-running the scripts.
figures/
